Common mistakes

1. Forgetting to register EventHandler as an OSGi service.
2. Using an incorrect event topic.
3. Forgetting the PATHS property in ResourceChangeListener.
4. Assuming postEvent() waits for event processing.
5. Performing long-running operations directly inside an event callback.
6. Assuming EventAdmin guarantees successful processing.
7. Assuming ResourceChangeListener receives external changes automatically.


